        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the tranquility of Patch of Heaven, a charming 2D pixel art greenhouse simulator designed for your relaxation. Here, your plants never die, allowing you to enjoy gardening without pressure. The main goal isn't to win, but to find an oasis of calm. Furthermore, Patch of Heaven doesn't have a traditional background, allowing you to use it as a relaxing widget on your desktop while you work or do other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744780/extras/f8f37bddb07f7f86e34dd166f10be563.avif?t=1756354409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744780/extras_big/f8f37bddb07f7f86e34dd166f10be563.avif?t=1756354409 width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Gardening:</strong> Dedicate yourself to watering, transplanting, moving, and pruning your plants at your own pace. Watch them flourish and grow under your care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Multitasking Oasis:</strong> Enjoy the beauty of your greenhouse directly on your desktop. By not having a full-screen background, Patch of Heaven can function as a widget, offering you a touch of nature and calm while you remain productive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prosper and Expand:</strong> Once your plants are fully grown, prune them and sell the excess for profit. Use your earnings to acquire seeds for more exotic and rare plants, which in turn will offer greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Sanctuary:</strong> Decorate your greenhouse to your liking. Place your plants wherever you prefer and complement the space with a variety of adornments available in the shop, from adorable rabbits and atmospheric lanterns to comfortable chairs and tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Well-being:</strong> Enjoy a carefully selected color palette and a soundtrack composed in 432 Hz, elements that, according to studies, contribute to reducing anxiety and stress levels, creating a truly relaxing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patch of Heaven, your sole objective is to cultivate your own corner of peace, whether as an immersive experience or as a serene companion in your day-to-day life. Create the greenhouse of your dreams and let serenity flourish!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the tranquility of Patch of Heaven, a charming 2D pixel art greenhouse simulator designed for your relaxation. Here, your plants never die, allowing you to enjoy gardening without pressure. The main goal isn't to win, but to find an oasis of calm. Furthermore, Patch of Heaven doesn't have a traditional background, allowing you to use it as a relaxing widget on your desktop while you work or do other tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744780/extras/f8f37bddb07f7f86e34dd166f10be563.avif?t=1756354409\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744780/extras_big/f8f37bddb07f7f86e34dd166f10be563.avif?t=1756354409 width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Gardening:</strong> Dedicate yourself to watering, transplanting, moving, and pruning your plants at your own pace. Watch them flourish and grow under your care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Multitasking Oasis:</strong> Enjoy the beauty of your greenhouse directly on your desktop. By not having a full-screen background, Patch of Heaven can function as a widget, offering you a touch of nature and calm while you remain productive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prosper and Expand:</strong> Once your plants are fully grown, prune them and sell the excess for profit. Use your earnings to acquire seeds for more exotic and rare plants, which in turn will offer greater rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Sanctuary:</strong> Decorate your greenhouse to your liking. Place your plants wherever you prefer and complement the space with a variety of adornments available in the shop, from adorable rabbits and atmospheric lanterns to comfortable chairs and tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Well-being:</strong> Enjoy a carefully selected color palette and a soundtrack composed in 432 Hz, elements that, according to studies, contribute to reducing anxiety and stress levels, creating a truly relaxing experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Patch of Heaven, your sole objective is to cultivate your own corner of peace, whether as an immersive experience or as a serene companion in your day-to-day life. Create the greenhouse of your dreams and let serenity flourish!</p>",
        "short_description": "Meet Patch of Heaven, a playable sticker for your desktop. Place this transparent greenhouse anywhere on your screen and curate your own garden with immortal, pixel-art plants. They grow passively in the background while you work or play—no stress, no watering, just pure relaxation and lo-fi beats!",
